<title>GREECE: SPYROU AGRICULTURE IPO OVERSUBSCRIBED- PIRAEUS BANK.</title>
<headline>SPYROU AGRICULTURE IPO OVERSUBSCRIBED- PIRAEUS BANK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of Spyrou Agriculture was oversubscribed more than 40 times based on preliminary figures, issue advisor and lead underwriter Piraeus Bank told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;The offering was oversubscribed more than 40 times,&quot; said investment banking officer Leonidas Thomas.</p>
<p>Spyrou Agriculture which markets seeds went public at 1,350 drachmas a share with an issue of 750,000 shares. It raised 1.012 billion drachmas.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
